gner</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Mallubhotla</surname><given-names>HD</given-names></name><name><surname>Hood</surname><given-names>EE</given-names></name><name><surname>Dangott</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Tichy</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Howard</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Maize (Zea mays)-derived bovine trypsin: Characterization of the first large-scale, commercial protein product from transgenic plants</article-title><source>Biotechnol Appl Biochem</source><year>2003</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>123</fpage><lpage>130</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12749769</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1042/BA20030026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bogers</surname><given-names>WM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergmeier</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ma</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Oostermeijer</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelly</surname><given-names>CG</given-names></name><name><surname>Ten Haaft</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Heeney</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Lehner</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A novel HIV-CCR5 receptor vaccine strategy in the control of mucosal SIV/HIV infection </article-title><source>AIDS</source><year>2004</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>25</fpage><lpage>36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15090826</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00002030-200401020-00003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Obregon</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Chargelegue</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Drake</surname><given-names>PMW</given-names></name><name><surname>Prada</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Nuttall</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Frigerio</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Ma</surname><given-names>JKC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>HIV-1 p24-immunoglobulin fusion molecule: a new strategy for plant-based protein production</article-title><source>Plant Biotechnology Journal</source><year>2006</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>195</fpage><lpage>207</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17177796</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1467-7652.2005.00171.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karasev</surname><given-names>AV</given-names></name><name><surname>Foulke</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wellens</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Rich</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Shon</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Zwierzynski</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Hone</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Koprowski</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Reitz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plant based HIV-1 vaccine candidate: Tat protein produced in spinach</article-title><source>Vaccine</source><year>2005</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>1875</fpage><lpage>1880</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15734059</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.vaccine.2004.11.021</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Robert-Guroff</surname><given-nam